2026-10-09T03:57:11.6663556Z # System-wide .bashrc file for interactive bash(1) shells.
2026-10-09T03:57:11.6663780Z 
2026-10-09T03:57:11.6663997Z # To enable the settings / commands in this file for login shells as well,
